Changes: retain only the trained x4 network; remove registry, weight
initialization and x1/x2 branches; use non-in-place activations; add fixed
RGB image normalization, clipping and output scaling for Core ML.

Conversion tools are development-only dependencies. The application ships
only model data and runs it with Apple's system Core ML framework.
